### ✅ Well-Organized Areas

- **`tests/providers/`** — Clean grouping by provider (gemini, claude, minimax, etc.). Each has internal structure that mirrors the proxy's provider support.
- **`tests/multi-model/`** — Clear naming, all testing the same concept (running with N models).
- **`tests/unit/`** — Correct location for pure unit tests (`.test.ts` files testing isolated logic).
- **`tests/api/`** — Good grouping by API endpoint (`v1-messages`, `interactions`, `responses`, `cached-content`).

