## 1. Current Layout Summary

The test directory has **73 files** across **9 top-level directories** and **~5 root-level files**:

**Root-level (5 files)** — Multi-agent runners & a legacy test harness:
- `multi-agents-test.ts` / `.py` — TS & Python multi-agent SDK runners
- `multi-agents-composite.ts` — Judge-worker composite test (800+ lines)
- `run-tests-loop-wrapper.js` — Harness for old `./testcases/` directory

**`unit/` (6 files)** — Proper offline unit tests using `node:test`
- `auth-with-model.test.ts`, `token-usage.test.ts`, `routing.test.ts`, `openai-gemini-role-default.test.ts`, `think-tag-extraction.test.ts`, `responses-gemini-url.test.ts`

**`infra/` (5 files)** — Config / infra scripts + **1 misplaced unit test**
- `config.sh`, `version.sh`, `shell.sh`, `debug-config.js`
- ❌ `tool-blocklist.ts` — This is a unit test for `eraseBlockedTools()`, should be in `unit/`

**`providers/` (23 files)** — Provider-specific integration tests (shell-based)
- `gemini/` (11 files, including `sdk/` subdir with 6 files)
- `claude/` (4 files), `deepseek/` (2), `minimax/` (1), `glm/` (1), `llama/` (1)

**`features/` (16 files)** — Feature-specific test suites
- `streaming/` (3), `thinking/` (4), `routing/` (3), `token-counting/` (5)

**`multi-model/` (6 files)** — Multi-model orchestration tests (all `.sh`)

**`scripts/` (1 file)** — `transform-dump.py` (data migration tool, not a test)

**`logs/` (~35 files)** — Generated run artifacts (results + fix-sessions)

